<title>USA: Corimon, Centennial do not open - NYSE.</title>
<headline>Corimon, Centennial do not open - NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Corimon SACA and Centennial Technologies Inc did not open for trading on the exchange on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
